      <div class="area-body">
      <h2>Terms you may come across</h2>
      <p>These are general definitions to help you follow the process. They are not legal, financial or medical advice.</p>
      <dl>
        <dt id="downsizing" style="margin-top:20px;font-weight:400;font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;font-size:20px;color:#1a1a1a">Downsizing</dt><dd style="margin:6px 0 0;color:#555;font-size:16px;line-height:1.8">Moving to a smaller or more manageable home, often after children have left or when upkeep becomes harder.</dd>
        <dt id="later-life-move" style="margin-top:20px;font-weight:400;font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;font-size:20px;color:#1a1a1a">Later-life move</dt><dd style="margin:6px 0 0;color:#555;font-size:16px;line-height:1.8">A move made in later life, often to a smaller home, a bungalow, a retirement property or closer to family.</dd>
        <dt id="senior-move-manager" style="margin-top:20px;font-weight:400;font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;font-size:20px;color:#1a1a1a">Senior move manager</dt><dd style="margin:6px 0 0;color:#555;font-size:16px;line-height:1.8">A professional who plans and coordinates a move for an older person. See <a href="/senior-move-manager-uk/">what a senior move manager is</a>.</dd>
        <dt id="removals-company" style="margin-top:20px;font-weight:400;font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;font-size:20px;color:#1a1a1a">Removals company</dt><dd style="margin:6px 0 0;color:#555;font-size:16px;line-height:1.8">A company that transports your belongings from one property to another, sometimes with packing.</dd>
        <dt id="full-service-move" style="margin-top:20px;font-weight:400;font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;font-size:20px;color:#1a1a1a">Full-service move</dt><dd style="margin:6px 0 0;color:#555;font-size:16px;line-height:1.8">A move where sorting, packing, removal, liaison and settling in are all managed together, rather than booked separately.</dd>
        <dt id="decluttering" style="margin-top:20px;font-weight:400;font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;font-size:20px;color:#1a1a1a">Decluttering</dt><dd style="margin:6px 0 0;color:#555;font-size:16px;line-height:1.8">Sorting belongings into keep, sell, donate and let go before a move.</dd>
        <dt id="packing-service" style="margin-top:20px;font-weight:400;font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;font-size:20px;color:#1a1a1a">Packing service</dt><dd style="margin:6px 0 0;color:#555;font-size:16px;line-height:1.8">Professional packing of belongings, usually labelled by destination room.</dd>
        <dt id="estate-agent" style="margin-top:20px;font-weight:400;font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;font-size:20px;color:#1a1a1a">Estate agent</dt><dd style="margin:6px 0 0;color:#555;font-size:16px;line-height:1.8">A professional who markets and sells property. Chayce is not an estate agent.</dd>
        <dt id="solicitor-or-conveyancer" style="margin-top:20px;font-weight:400;font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;font-size:20px;color:#1a1a1a">Solicitor or conveyancer</dt><dd style="margin:6px 0 0;color:#555;font-size:16px;line-height:1.8">A legal professional who handles the legal side of buying and selling property.</dd>
        <dt id="conveyancing" style="margin-top:20px;font-weight:400;font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;font-size:20px;color:#1a1a1a">Conveyancing</dt><dd style="margin:6px 0 0;color:#555;font-size:16px;line-height:1.8">The legal process of transferring ownership of a property from seller to buyer.</dd>
        <dt id="exchange-of-contracts" style="margin-top:20px;font-weight:400;font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;font-size:20px;color:#1a1a1a">Exchange of contracts</dt><dd style="margin:6px 0 0;color:#555;font-size:16px;line-height:1.8">The point at which the buyer and seller become legally committed to the sale.</dd>
        <dt id="completion-date" style="margin-top:20px;font-weight:400;font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;font-size:20px;color:#1a1a1a">Completion date</dt><dd style="margin:6px 0 0;color:#555;font-size:16px;line-height:1.8">The day the sale completes and ownership transfers. It is usually the day you must move out.</dd>
        <dt id="property-chain" style="margin-top:20px;font-weight:400;font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;font-size:20px;color:#1a1a1a">Property chain</dt><dd style="margin:6px 0 0;color:#555;font-size:16px;line-height:1.8">A series of linked sales and purchases that depend on one another, where one delay can affect all.</dd>
        <dt id="bungalow" style="margin-top:20px;font-weight:400;font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;font-size:20px;color:#1a1a1a">Bungalow</dt><dd style="margin:6px 0 0;color:#555;font-size:16px;line-height:1.8">A single-storey home, popular with downsizers because there are no stairs.</dd>
        <dt id="retirement-apartment" style="margin-top:20px;font-weight:400;font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;font-size:20px;color:#1a1a1a">Retirement apartment</dt><dd style="margin:6px 0 0;color:#555;font-size:16px;line-height:1.8">A flat in a development designed for older people, often with communal facilities.</dd>
        <dt id="retirement-village" style="margin-top:20px;font-weight:400;font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;font-size:20px;color:#1a1a1a">Retirement village</dt><dd style="margin:6px 0 0;color:#555;font-size:16px;line-height:1.8">A community of homes for older people with shared facilities and, in some cases, care options.</dd>
        <dt id="sheltered-housing" style="margin-top:20px;font-weight:400;font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;font-size:20px;color:#1a1a1a">Sheltered housing</dt><dd style="margin:6px 0 0;color:#555;font-size:16px;line-height:1.8">Housing for older people, often with a scheme manager and communal areas, so residents can live independently.</dd>
        <dt id="care-home" style="margin-top:20px;font-weight:400;font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;font-size:20px;color:#1a1a1a">Care home</dt><dd style="margin:6px 0 0;color:#555;font-size:16px;line-height:1.8">A residential setting where care is provided for people who need it. Chayce does not provide care or care advice.</dd>
        <dt id="mail-redirection" style="margin-top:20px;font-weight:400;font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;font-size:20px;color:#1a1a1a">Mail redirection</dt><dd style="margin:6px 0 0;color:#555;font-size:16px;line-height:1.8">A Royal Mail service that forwards post from your old address to your new one for a set period.</dd>
        <dt id="probate" style="margin-top:20px;font-weight:400;font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;font-size:20px;color:#1a1a1a">Probate</dt><dd style="margin:6px 0 0;color:#555;font-size:16px;line-height:1.8">The legal process of dealing with a person's estate after they die. Chayce does not give legal advice.</dd>
      </dl>
      </div>
    </div>
